{"alignment_excerpts": [{"asr_text": "我承认,自从我丈夫失踪后,我就一直精神紧张,但我发誓,我的阁楼里真的有东西,而且他妈的,才不是我父母一直坚称的那样,是我的幻觉,事情发生在他失踪后的第五天。", "chunk_end_index": 8, "chunk_index": 0, "end_seconds": 19.54, "exact_match_characters": 69, "match_ratio": 1.0, "normalized_characters": 69, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 0.0}, {"asr_text": "我往回翻到出事前一晚我在后院的录像一个人坐在后门廊上右手端着威士忌左手夹着烟那些片段我大概看了上百遍了其中三个触发了动作传感器在不同时间点", "chunk_end_index": 84, "chunk_index": 77, "end_seconds": 176.82, "exact_match_characters": 69, "match_ratio": 1.0, "normalized_characters": 69, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 158.26}, {"asr_text": " 报警我跑回卧室拿起电话拨了911拨号的时候头顶的闷响更多了越来越响哦 不不", "chunk_end_index": 162, "chunk_index": 155, "end_seconds": 321.08, "exact_match_characters": 36, "match_ratio": 1.0, "normalized_characters": 36, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 308.74}, {"asr_text": "另一个警官开口但我已经把自己拉进了阁楼然后我看见了他在警官手电筒的光束照射下不是破门而入的陌生人是朱丽安朱丽安的尸体他被靠在一些箱子边", "chunk_end_index": 235, "chunk_index": 226, "end_seconds": 443.58, "exact_match_characters": 65, "match_ratio": 0.9701492537313433, "normalized_characters": 67, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 424.28}, {"asr_text": "他们就会蔓延到我的脖子几天或几周都没区别了我肯定到那时候我早就不在了", "chunk_end_index": 309, "chunk_index": 305, "end_seconds": 613.38, "exact_match_characters": 33, "match_ratio": 0.9705882352941176, "normalized_characters": 34, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 604.08}], "errors": [], "metrics": {"speechbrain_ecapa_sim": {"count": 5, "max": 0.7998061180114746, "mean": 0.7398878455162048, "min": 0.6816426515579224, "scores": [0.7709887027740479, 0.7516621351242065, 0.7998061180114746, 0.6953396201133728, 0.6816426515579224], "std": 0.044884615632848415}, "wavlm_sim": {"count": 5, "max": 0.9857523441314697, "mean": 0.9789101600646972, "min": 0.9759658575057983, "scores": [0.9779555797576904, 0.9857523441314697, 0.9759658575057983, 0.97832