{"alignment_excerpts": [{"asr_text": "我承认,自从我丈夫失踪后,我就一直精神紧张,但我发誓,我的阁楼里真的有东西,而且他妈的才不是我父母一直坚称的那样,是我的幻觉。事情发生在他失踪后的第五天", "chunk_end_index": 7, "chunk_index": 0, "end_seconds": 17.2, "exact_match_characters": 69, "match_ratio": 1.0, "normalized_characters": 69, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 0.0}, {"asr_text": "只有我进进出出车道去买菜或办事我往回翻到出事前一晚我在后院的录像一个人坐在后门廊上右手断着威士忌左手夹着烟那些片段我大概看了上百遍了", "chunk_end_index": 82, "chunk_index": 73, "end_seconds": 169.86, "exact_match_characters": 65, "match_ratio": 0.9848484848484849, "normalized_characters": 66, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 150.0}, {"asr_text": "我挂断电话时闷响停了我站在床上锁着门盯着我上方的天花板求你了别出来求你了床头柜上的时钟显示", "chunk_end_index": 168, "chunk_index": 160, "end_seconds": 343.86, "exact_match_characters": 45, "match_ratio": 1.0, "normalized_characters": 45, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 330.0}, {"asr_text": "另一个警官开口但我已经把自己拉进了阁楼然后我看见了他在警官手电筒的光束照射下不是破门而入的梦是朱利安朱利安的尸体她被靠在一些箱子边保持着坐姿", "chunk_end_index": 225, "chunk_index": 217, "end_seconds": 457.84, "exact_match_characters": 68, "match_ratio": 0.9714285714285714, "normalized_characters": 70, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 438.18}, {"asr_text": "那些红痕已经爬上了我的躯干我的手臂再过几个小时他们就会卖暗眼到我的脖子几天或几周都没区别了我肯定到那时候我早就不在了", "chunk_end_index": 299, "chunk_index": 293, "end_seconds": 638.28, "exact_match_characters": 54, "match_ratio": 0.9310344827586207, "normalized_characters": 58, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 621.44}], "errors": [], "metrics": {"speechbrain_ecapa_sim": {"count": 5, "max": 0.8220568895339966, "mean": 0.7441353559494018, "min": 0.6440190672874451, "scores": [0.781326413154602, 0.7450657486915588, 0.6440190672874451, 0.7282086610794067, 0.8220568895339966], "std": 0.059552895190404374}, "wavlm_sim": {"count": 5, "max": 0.9891887903213501, "mean": 0.9851309776306152, "min": 0.982414186000824, "scores": [0.985508143901825, 0.9891887