{"alignment_excerpts": [{"asr_text": "我承认,自从我丈夫失踪后,我就一直精神紧张,但我发誓,我的阁楼里真的有东西,而且他妈的才不是我,父母一直坚称的那样,是我的幻觉。事情发生在他失踪后的第五天", "chunk_end_index": 8, "chunk_index": 0, "end_seconds": 18.84, "exact_match_characters": 69, "match_ratio": 1.0, "normalized_characters": 69, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 0.0}, {"asr_text": "我大概看了上百遍了其中三个触发了动作传感器在不同时间点拍到了凌晨时分独自一人的我我刚刚知道自己流产了没有去依靠它反而像往常一样退缩了独自在黑暗里用烟酒甜", "chunk_end_index": 88, "chunk_index": 79, "end_seconds": 179.98, "exact_match_characters": 74, "match_ratio": 0.9736842105263158, "normalized_characters": 76, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 160.2}, {"asr_text": ",我挂断电话时闷响停了,我站在床上锁着门,盯着我上方的天花板,求你了,别出来求你了,床头柜上的时钟显示802,快点来求你了,我浑身发抖,盯着离我鼻子", "chunk_end_index": 160, "chunk_index": 152, "end_seconds": 321.12, "exact_match_characters": 65, "match_ratio": 1.0, "normalized_characters": 65, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 301.94}, {"asr_text": "然后我想起来了记忆的零星碎片坐在后门廊上喝着威士忌越喝越醉进进出出和她争吵她谈论着组建家庭的梦想也许在四次流产后", "chunk_end_index": 216, "chunk_index": 210, "end_seconds": 449.82, "exact_match_characters": 54, "match_ratio": 0.9642857142857143, "normalized_characters": 56, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 434.02}, {"asr_text": "几天或几周都没区别我肯定到那时候我早就不在了", "chunk_end_index": 271, "chunk_index": 269, "end_seconds": 572.92, "exact_match_characters": 22, "match_ratio": 1.0, "normalized_characters": 22, "role_purity": 1.0, "selection_tier": "standard", "start_seconds": 566.46}], "errors": [], "metrics": {"speechbrain_ecapa_sim": {"count": 5, "max": 0.8298496007919312, "mean": 0.7857184529304504, "min": 0.7077013254165649, "scores": [0.8081916570663452, 0.804916501045227, 0.8298496007919312, 0.7779331803321838, 0.7077013254165649], "std": 0.04235197946275933}, "wavlm_sim": {"count": 5, "max": 0.9910033941268921, "mean": 0.9729642510414124, "min": 0.9432284832000732, "scores": [0.9817870855331421, 0.9791290163993835, 0.991003394